---
// Retired into /pipeline/relation-vocab.
//
// This was never a review of a layer. It is the decision queue for one open question — what
// `dissociates-with` means — with the evidence per pair and `decision: pending` until a person
// rules. That belongs to the question layer it will settle.
//
// Approval of a layer's output is a different thing and is not a page: it is an operation on a
// version, recorded in runs/<paper>/approvals.jsonl and shown on the cell it applies to.
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
return Astro.redirect(`${base}/pipeline/relation-vocab/`, 301);
---
